#: .\templates\Lobby\index.html:39
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "From <a href=\"https://www.splottershop.com/\" target=\"_blank"
#| "\">Splotter's</a> website: <BR /> <i>Horseless Carriage is a game about "
#| "the dawn of the automobile: a time when cars were invented, and no one "
#| "quite knew yet what this new contraption would look like, and what "
#| "features would be essential. Early cars sometimes used levers or pedals "
#| "to steer and a wheel to accelerate. Brakes were not always seen as "
#| "essential; but sometimes an outside spot to take along an onboard "
#| "mechanic was. This early, super innovative period occurs in the "
#| "development of many new product categories. Players are cast as aspiring "
#| "industrialists trying to find out what features the public will value "
#| "when buying these new, expensive, and utterly unfamiliar horseless "
#| "carriages."
msgid ""
"From <a href=\"https://www.splottershop.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Splotter's</"
"a> website: <br /> <i>Horseless Carriage is a game about the dawn of the "
"automobile: a time when cars were invented, and no one quite knew yet what "
"this new contraption would look like, and what features would be essential. "
"Early cars sometimes used levers or pedals to steer and a wheel to "
"accelerate. Brakes were not always seen as essential; but sometimes an "
"outside spot to take along an onboard mechanic was. This early, super "
"innovative period occurs in the development of many new product categories. "
"Players are cast as aspiring industrialists trying to find out what features "
"the public will value when buying these new, expensive, and utterly "
"unfamiliar horseless carriages."
msgstr ""
"来自<a href=\"https://www.splottershop.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Splotter </"
"a>网站：<BR /><i>《Horseless Carriage》是一款关于汽车黎明时期的游戏：当汽车被"
"发明时，没有人知道这个新装置会长什么样子，什么功能是必要的。早期的汽车有时使"
"用杆或踏板来转向，使用方向盘来加速。制动系统并不总是被视为必要的，有时候还要"
"带一个额外的机械师。许多新产品的早期超级创新期都会发生这种情况。玩家将扮演有"
"抱负的实业家，试图找出公众购买这些新的、昂贵的、完全陌生的后马车时代汽车时会"
"重视哪些功能。"

