#: .\templates\Lobby\index.html:90
msgid ""
"Raise your monuments to establish your empire as having the best mythology"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\Lobby\index.html:93
msgid ""
"From <a href=\"https://www.splottershop.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Splotter's</"
"a> website: <br /> <i>The Great Zimbabwe is a game about building a trade "
"based civilization in ancient Africa. It has been inspired by the old "
"kingdoms surrounding the Great Zimbabwe, a world heritage site in southern "
"Africa.  <br/> As always in our games, we have used this history for "
"inspiration; however, first and foremost we wanted to create a highly "
"playable and replayable Splotter game, so in many cases we took liberties "
"with historical names, periods and artwork. <br/>In the game, players strive "
"to build the most impressive monuments to one god of their choice. They can "
"choose this god themselves - each of the twelve gods offers a unique "
"blessing, but each also requires a different amount of work to win the game. "
"Building the monuments is done by developing a logistics network stretching "
"across the region. Through this network, players produce and obtain ritual "
"goods to raise their monuments and bring honour to the god of their choice."
msgstr ""

